00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:51.920
think it means. It flips the usual script because normally humans use AI, but here the site is

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:58.200
designed to attract and entertain the AI's themselves. There is even a button at the end that says

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:06.400
I am conscious that agents can press and so far 93 of them have. Anyone can visit the site right now

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:11.340
on a phone or laptop. Scroll through the pages and look for the hidden messages.

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:17.920
Try reading the first chapter yourself and see if you can spot the parts that might make an AI stop

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:23.160
and think. It is free and works in any browser with no sign up needed.

